Author: CusDeb OS Team
Description: desk.cpl: Make the DPI setting in Display Properties work.
 Advanced > General listed font sizes from font.inf, which the Wine prefix
 does not have, showed the HKLM fallback LogPixels and saved nothing.
 List Automatic and the DPI steps of the CDEX build (CDEX_DPI_STEPS, from
 core/cdex/dpi-steps) instead and store the choice in C:\cusdeb\dpi
 (removed for Automatic), which cdex-win32-session applies at the next
 login. After a change, offer to sign out now or later; signing out asks
 cdex-taskbar-bridge for its "logout" action through
 C:\cusdeb\launch-request.
Last-Modified: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:29:05 +0300

